{"desc": "This Pattern was posted by chase2k25. Tagged with: pattern, orange, abstract, pixelated, pattern, texture.", "image": "/data/library-cache/files/7cc5cb731e3450e7fc04.jpg", "tailwind": false, "html": "<div class=\"sandpaper-pattern\">\n  <svg class=\"sandpaper-svg\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n    <defs>\n      <filter id=\"sandTexture\">\n        <feTurbulence\n          result=\"sand\"\n          seed=\"20\"\n          numOctaves=\"4\"\n          baseFrequency=\"0.6\"\n          type=\"fractalNoise\"\n        ></feTurbulence>\n        <feColorMatrix\n          values=\"0.8 0 0 0 0.1  0 0.7 0 0 0.05  0 0 0.6 0 0.02  0 0 0 1 0\"\n          type=\"matrix\"\n        ></feColorMatrix>\n      </filter>\n    </defs>\n    <rect filter=\"url(#sandTexture)\" height=\"100%\" width=\"100%\"></rect>\n  </svg>\n</div>\n", "css": ".sandpaper-pattern {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  background: #755139;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.sandpaper-svg {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  display: block;\n  opacity: 0.85;\n}\n", "license": "mit"}